<div class="caption">
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></h3>
<p style="text-align: center;">Check the warranty period and availability of customer support and service centres to ensure you're covered in case of any issues. At Clenli Direct, we offer free delivery, training, comprehensive warranties, and we have our own in-house service team for complete peace of mind!</p>
